Package: paperrepo
Type: Package
Title: Create Reproducible Project Structures for Empirical Papers
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Zander", "Prinsloo",
           email = "62433917+zander-prinsloo@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Create a convention-driven, Quarto-first project structure for
    empirical research papers. The scaffold includes analysis folders,
    reproducibility files, dated research notes, manuscript rendering helpers,
    and a journal-ready TeX handoff.
